"| ------------------ | ---------------- | ----------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------- | ------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"|  $NH_3$ (8o,10e)   |  16              |  3136             |  1936               |  0.08                    |  6                  | 37 s          | 34 s              |\n"
